<title>ITALY: Italy says plans French franc, long-term Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Italy says plans French franc, long-term Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian republic plans to issue a long-term Eurobond denominated in French francs, the Treasury said in a brief statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said CDC Marches and JP Morgan would act as joint bookrunners for the transaction.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
